      "statement": "ADR-PAY-019 was adopted in direct response to the Wire Status Lite pilot incident (CBO-3120 / INC-2024-1182), in which 30-second client-side polling of PPH v1 status at month-end volume exhausted PPH's shared API thread pool and delayed wire release for 47 minutes; the post-implementation review's remediation explicitly called for a reusable CBO status projection service, delivered for ACH via CBO-3815 in 2025.",
